        "An automations builder defines what runs and when. Cortex uses it internally for dependency upgrades, CVE fixes and bug triage.",
        "The orchestrator is AGPL-3.0, with harness SDK crates under Apache-2.0. engrams is free, with no hosted service; Cortex separately sells an internal developer portal."
