        "The CLI, VS Code extension, desktop app and SDK are open source under the Apache-2.0 license. The client is free, with pay-per-use inference through the Cline provider, or users can bring their own keys. An Enterprise tier adds SSO, SCIM, audit logs, RBAC, an SLA and dedicated support."
