        "Around the agents, Tempo adds issues, product requirement documents and a design canvas, all of which write to the real codebase. Background agents can also be started from Slack, GitHub or on a schedule.",
        "Tempo began as a web-based prompt-to-React builder before moving to this desktop workspace in 2026. Tempo Inference credits are available as an optional alternative to bringing your own subscription."
