        "Floot is a platform for building web apps with a purpose-built framework and a built-in backend, database and hosting on AWS. It started as a browser-based, AI-first app builder for people who do not code.",
        "Today Floot also works as a connector: agents such as Claude, ChatGPT or Cursor drive it over MCP, writing the code on the user’s own subscription. Its own builder agent is optional. Output is TypeScript and React, and the platform includes autonomous error fixing."
