        "The Poolside Platform runs self-managed agents inside the customer’s own security boundary, including on-premises and air-gapped environments. Developers work through the pool CLI or the Poolside Assistant for VS Code, Visual Studio and macOS, and can add MCP servers.",
        "Poolside sells mainly to large enterprises and government on a subscription basis without per-token fees, with free developer previews also available. Its models are also offered on Amazon Bedrock, OpenRouter and Vercel AI Gateway."
